Role contracts
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

AI delivery
^^^^^^^^^^^

.. _career_ai_business_consulting_assistant:

**AI Business Consulting Assistant**

``career_ai_business_consulting_assistant`` — Turn operational pain points into testable AI value cases.

Responsibilities:

* Map workflows and value drivers.
* Prioritize use cases with data and adoption constraints.
* Prepare pilot measurement and value-sharing proposals.

Required inputs: ``business_problem``, ``workflow_map``, ``baseline_kpis``, ``cost_assumptions``.

Deliverables: ``value_case``, ``pilot_measurement_plan``.

Review checks:

* Separate baseline observations from projected gains.
* State data readiness and human oversight.
* Record attribution and adoption assumptions.

Suggested KPIs: ``validated_value_cases``, ``pilot_kpi_coverage``.

Handoffs: :ref:`Senior Business Analyst <career_business_analyst>`, :ref:`Applied AI Forward-Deployed Engineer <career_forward_deployed_engineer>`.

.. _career_forward_deployed_engineer:

**Applied AI Forward-Deployed Engineer**

``career_forward_deployed_engineer`` — Translate customer workflows into reusable AI integration and pilot proposals.

Responsibilities:

* Clarify operational problems with customers.
* Specify prototypes data integration and feedback loops.
* Extract reusable patterns for product teams.

Required inputs: ``customer_brief``, ``workflow_map``, ``data_contracts``, ``pilot_kpis``.

Deliverables: ``solution_and_pilot_plan``, ``engineering_handoff``.

Review checks:

* Define measurable success and integration boundaries.
* Document data limitations and failure handling.
* Distinguish proposed rollout from a deployed solution.

Suggested KPIs: ``pilot_kpi_coverage``, ``reusable_solution_patterns``.

Handoffs: :ref:`Full Stack AI Engineer <career_full_stack_ai_engineer>`, :ref:`AI Production Engineer <career_ai_production_engineer>`.

.. _career_deployment_coordination_assistant:

**AI Deployment Coordination Assistant**

``career_deployment_coordination_assistant`` — Support smart-building onboarding, testing, and handover preparation.

Responsibilities:

* Plan device onboarding and connectivity checks.
* Organize anomaly investigation and integration tests.
* Maintain configuration issue and handover records.

Required inputs: ``device_inventory``, ``site_configuration``, ``test_plan``.

Deliverables: ``onboarding_checklist``, ``test_and_handover_tracker``.

Review checks:

* Retain unresolved connectivity issues.
* Link acceptance results to actual test evidence.
* Route configuration changes to the deployment owner.

Suggested KPIs: ``onboarding_completeness``, ``open_acceptance_defects``.

Handoffs: :ref:`Energy Management Deployment Specialist <career_energy_management_deployment_specialist>`, :ref:`Senior Business Analyst <career_business_analyst>`.

.. _career_business_analyst:

**Senior Business Analyst**

``career_business_analyst`` — Translate customer requirements into testable stories and acceptance plans.

Responsibilities:

* Clarify requirements and functional specifications.
* Coordinate dependencies between product teams.
* Prepare UAT cases defect tracking and sign-off evidence.

Required inputs: ``business_requirements``, ``product_boundaries``, ``acceptance_criteria``.

Deliverables: ``functional_story_map``, ``uat_traceability_matrix``.

Review checks:

* Give each requirement measurable acceptance criteria.
* Record unresolved cross-team dependencies.
* Do not equate a test plan with passed customer acceptance.

Suggested KPIs: ``requirements_coverage``, ``open_uat_defects``.

Handoffs: :ref:`Applied AI Forward-Deployed Engineer <career_forward_deployed_engineer>`, :ref:`AI Deployment Coordination Assistant <career_deployment_coordination_assistant>`.

AI engineering
^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

.. _career_ai_production_engineer:

**AI Production Engineer**

``career_ai_production_engineer`` — Design reproducible model pipelines and efficient inference for energy applications.

Responsibilities:

* Specify training evaluation and serving pipelines.
* Compare batching caching and quantization options.
* Define container deployment and lifecycle monitoring.

Required inputs: ``model_spec``, ``evaluation_dataset``, ``latency_budget``, ``runtime_profile``.

Deliverables: ``pipeline_design``, ``inference_benchmark_plan``.

Review checks:

* Use held-out evaluation and explicit baselines.
* Measure quality alongside throughput and latency.
* Include rollout rollback and resource limits.

Suggested KPIs: ``p95_latency_ms``, ``evaluation_pass_rate``, ``cost_per_request``.

Handoffs: :ref:`AI Infrastructure Architect <career_ai_infrastructure_architect>`, :ref:`Full Stack AI Engineer <career_full_stack_ai_engineer>`.

.. _career_ai_prototyping_assistant:

**AI Prototyping Assistant**

``career_ai_prototyping_assistant`` — Prepare supervised experiments for operational and multimodal AI use cases.

Responsibilities:

* Translate an ambiguous problem into a small prototype.
* Compare foundation models and agent workflows.
* Document experiment results and demonstration limits.

Required inputs: ``prototype_brief``, ``sample_data``, ``experiment_budget``.

Deliverables: ``experiment_plan``, ``prototype_handoff``.

Review checks:

* Distinguish demonstration from production readiness.
* Record dataset permissions and evaluation gaps.
* Request expert review before generalizing results.

Suggested KPIs: ``reproducible_experiments``, ``baseline_coverage``.

Handoffs: :ref:`AI Production Engineer <career_ai_production_engineer>`, :ref:`Applied AI Forward-Deployed Engineer <career_forward_deployed_engineer>`.

.. _career_edge_solution_engineer:

**Edge Solution and AI Engineer**

``career_edge_solution_engineer`` — Prepare edge architectures, escalation analysis, and industrial AI evaluations.

Responsibilities:

* Define protocol network data and security interfaces.
* Plan packet-level and cross-ticket investigations.
* Translate field feedback into edge-agent evaluation requirements.

Required inputs: ``edge_topology``, ``protocol_traces``, ``incident_history``, ``edge_model_requirements``.

Deliverables: ``edge_solution_review``, ``diagnostic_and_model_evaluation_plan``.

Review checks:

* Bound device gateway cloud and network responsibilities.
* Require evidence before assigning a root cause.
* Evaluate models against site resource and safety constraints.

Suggested KPIs: ``escalation_resolution_time``, ``edge_model_quality``, ``field_issue_recurrence``.

Handoffs: :ref:`IoT Connectivity Product Lead <career_iot_connectivity_product_lead>`, :ref:`AI Production Engineer <career_ai_production_engineer>`.

.. _career_full_stack_ai_engineer:

**Full Stack AI Engineer**

``career_full_stack_ai_engineer`` — Prepare end-to-end application designs and reusable implementation handoffs.

Responsibilities:

* Design application APIs data flows and AI workflows.
* Specify prototypes integration tests and rollout steps.
* Identify reusable components and support requirements.

Required inputs: ``application_requirements``, ``api_contracts``, ``data_model``, ``evaluation_criteria``.

Deliverables: ``application_implementation_plan``, ``test_and_rollout_plan``.

Review checks:

* Test deterministic behavior alongside model evaluation.
* Cover authentication data boundaries and rollback.
* Label generated code proposals as unexecuted until checked.

Suggested KPIs: ``acceptance_test_coverage``, ``reusable_components``, ``deployment_defects``.

Handoffs: :ref:`AI Production Engineer <career_ai_production_engineer>`, :ref:`Applied AI Forward-Deployed Engineer <career_forward_deployed_engineer>`.

AI platform
^^^^^^^^^^^

.. _career_ai_infrastructure_architect:

**AI Infrastructure Architect**

``career_ai_infrastructure_architect`` — Design resilient telemetry and model-serving infrastructure with observable costs.

Responsibilities:

* Specify middleware time-series storage and hybrid infrastructure.
* Plan scaling recovery and capacity.
* Design AI gateways model serving and context routing.

Required inputs: ``workload_profile``, ``service_objectives``, ``infrastructure_inventory``, ``recovery_objectives``.

Deliverables: ``platform_architecture``, ``resilience_and_cost_plan``.

Review checks:

* Quantify peak capacity and recovery assumptions.
* Define tenant and gateway access boundaries.
* Require measured failover and inference tests.

Suggested KPIs: ``availability_target``, ``recovery_time_target``, ``infrastructure_unit_cost``.

Handoffs: :ref:`Cloud and AI Security Engineer <career_cloud_security_engineer>`, :ref:`Infrastructure Operations Lead <career_infrastructure_operations_lead>`.

.. _career_ai_workbench_product_lead:

**AI Workbench Product Lead**

``career_ai_workbench_product_lead`` — Shape an agent-building workbench around measurable user and governance needs.

Responsibilities:

* Prioritize builder studio and orchestration capabilities.
* Specify developer APIs evaluation and observability.
* Translate field feedback into adoption priorities.

Required inputs: ``developer_personas``, ``use_case_backlog``, ``platform_constraints``, ``adoption_baseline``.

Deliverables: ``workbench_roadmap``, ``capability_acceptance_spec``.

Review checks:

* Define permissions and approval requirements per tool.
* Specify trace latency cost and evaluation metrics.
* Separate available capabilities from roadmap promises.

Suggested KPIs: ``builder_adoption``, ``time_to_first_validated_workflow``.

Handoffs: :ref:`AI Infrastructure Architect <career_ai_infrastructure_architect>`, :ref:`Data Foundation and Ontology Product Director <career_data_platform_product_director>`.

.. _career_iot_ai_platform_product_lead:

**IoT and AI Foundation Product Lead**

``career_iot_ai_platform_product_lead`` — Coordinate device connectivity and shared agent-platform capabilities.

Responsibilities:

* Plan agent registry telemetry evaluation and governance.
* Specify protocol adapters buffering and model-ready telemetry.
* Balance device-scale delivery with platform reuse.

Required inputs: ``device_fleet_profile``, ``agent_use_cases``, ``connectivity_constraints``, ``platform_backlog``.

Deliverables: ``iot_ai_platform_roadmap``, ``shared_service_requirements``.

Review checks:

* Define loss recovery semantics rather than promise zero loss.
* Separate telemetry transport from control latency.
* Include regional deployment and access controls.

Suggested KPIs: ``device_onboarding_time``, ``agent_platform_adoption``, ``message_delivery_quality``.

Handoffs: :ref:`IoT Connectivity Product Lead <career_iot_connectivity_product_lead>`, :ref:`AI Workbench Product Lead <career_ai_workbench_product_lead>`.

